  "description": "This program checks a string is palindrome or not (first half of the string is the same as the second half). ",
  "code": "public class RecursiveIsPalindrome{\n\n    public static void main(String args[]){ \n        String str = \"geeg\"; \n  \n        if (isPalindrome(str)) \n            System.out.println(\"Yes\"); \n        else\n            System.out.println(\"No\"); \n    } \n    \n     public boolean isPalindrome(String str) {\n             if (str.length() <= 1) {\n                 return true;\n             }\n             else{\n\n                 if (str.charAt(0) != str.charAt(str.length() - 1)){\n                     return false;\n                 } \n                 else{\n                     \n                     return isPalindrome(str.substring(1, str.length() - 1));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
